WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.300 --> 00:00:05.566
During Ash's first Gym badge challenge in the Kalos region,

2
00:00:05.633 --> 00:00:09.133
our hero battled Viola, the Santalune Gym Leader.

3
00:00:10.233 --> 00:00:11.933
But because Pikachu and Fletchling

4
00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:14.899
found it impossible to move freely on the battlefield,

5
00:00:14.966 --> 00:00:17.966
they were defeated by Viola's Surskit and Vivillon.

6
00:00:19.533 --> 00:00:22.366
Now, following a healing visit to the Pokémon Center,

7
00:00:22.433 --> 00:00:24.500
Ash has begun preparing for a rematch,

8
00:00:24.566 --> 00:00:28.433
with training assistance provided by Alexa.

9
00:00:31.500 --> 00:00:34.666
Vivillon's Gust isn't the only thing we have to deal with.

10
00:00:34.733 --> 00:00:37.566
There's Surskit's Ice Beam and Sticky Web too.

11
00:00:37.633 --> 00:00:39.933
How are we going to do it?

12
00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:42.800
♪ I want to be the very best ♪

13
00:00:42.866 --> 00:00:46.233
♪ Like no one ever was ♪

14
00:00:46.300 --> 00:00:49.300
♪ To catch them is my real test ♪

15
00:00:49.366 --> 00:00:52.266
♪ To train them is my cause ♪

16
00:00:52.333 --> 00:00:55.066
♪ Pokémon! Got to catch them all It's you and me ♪

17
00:00:55.133 --> 00:00:58.533
♪ Pokémon! I know it's my destiny ♪

18
00:00:58.599 --> 00:01:02.000
♪ Pokémon! Yeah, you're my best friend ♪

19
00:01:02.066 --> 00:01:04.666
♪ In a world we must defend ♪

20
00:01:04.733 --> 00:01:06.933
♪ Pokémon! Got to catch them all ♪

21
00:01:07.000 --> 00:01:10.000
♪ Got to catch them all! Pokémon ♪

22
00:01:22.266 --> 00:01:26.433
- Ash? Here, use this.
- Huh?

23
00:01:26.500 --> 00:01:28.933
Great! Thanks.

24
00:01:29.933 --> 00:01:33.733
Mm. Uh, here we go.

25
00:01:35.199 --> 00:01:38.100
Ash, do you remember me?

26
00:01:38.166 --> 00:01:39.966
Huh?

27
00:01:40.033 --> 00:01:43.399
Think back to when you went to camp in Pallet Town.

28
00:01:43.466 --> 00:01:45.566
I did too! That's where we met.

29
00:01:45.633 --> 00:01:47.600
- At camp?
- That's right!

30
00:01:47.666 --> 00:01:49.966
We met at Professor Oak's Pokémon Summer Camp!

31
00:01:50.033 --> 00:01:53.300
- Hey, I remember that camp!
- You really do?

32
00:01:53.366 --> 00:01:56.699
- Yeah! Of course. I went to it!
- I know!

33
00:01:56.766 --> 00:01:59.366
And that's because I went to that camp as well!

34
00:01:59.433 --> 00:02:02.766
Hm. Can't say I remember you.

35
00:02:02.833 --> 00:02:04.466
- Oh!
- Huh?

36
00:02:04.533 --> 00:02:06.699
Oh, no!

37
00:02:06.766 --> 00:02:08.933
Sorry.

38
00:02:09.000 --> 00:02:11.166
That's okay, Ash!

39
00:02:11.233 --> 00:02:13.333
For now, you need to concentrate on training.

40
00:02:13.400 --> 00:02:15.400
- You can remember me later.
- Right.

41
00:02:15.466 --> 00:02:18.700
I've got to say, Pokémon battles are amazing!

42
00:02:18.766 --> 00:02:20.166
You saw mine?

43
00:02:20.233 --> 00:02:23.166
Then you know what a totally rotten mess I made of it.

44
00:02:23.233 --> 00:02:26.600
A mess? I don't think so! You were awesome!

45
00:02:26.666 --> 00:02:29.133
I remember what you said the last time we met,

46
00:02:29.200 --> 00:02:31.666
- you never give up until the end!
- Huh?

47
00:02:31.733 --> 00:02:35.566
You're obviously not giving up. You haven't changed one bit!

48
00:02:37.666 --> 00:02:39.966
I haven't changed, have I?

49
00:02:45.200 --> 00:02:49.000
I'm not giving up. That just wouldn't be me at all.

50
00:02:49.066 --> 00:02:52.066
Thanks, Serena. You're a big help!

51
00:02:52.133 --> 00:02:54.233
Ah, sure.

52
00:02:55.600 --> 00:02:57.900
Alexa! Can we have another battle, please?

53
00:02:57.966 --> 00:02:59.000
Okay!

54
00:02:59.066 --> 00:03:01.200
- Fletchling!
- Pikachu!

55
00:03:01.266 --> 00:03:03.533
It's not like me to get all down on myself.

56
00:03:03.600 --> 00:03:06.066
I can fix all of this by not giving up!

57
00:03:07.066 --> 00:03:09.100
- Ready to go?
- Yah!

58
00:03:10.633 --> 00:03:13.033
Noivern, use Gust!

59
00:03:18.966 --> 00:03:20.700
Stay strong! Don't give up!

60
00:03:22.899 --> 00:03:26.433
Get your footing, Pikachu! And Fletchling, keep your balance!

61
00:03:26.500 --> 00:03:30.566
Pika! Pika!

62
00:03:30.633 --> 00:03:33.100
All right! Pikachu's using its tail!

63
00:03:33.166 --> 00:03:36.899
Great! In that position, Pikachu should be able keep its footing that way!

64
00:03:36.966 --> 00:03:39.899
Fletchling!

65
00:03:39.966 --> 00:03:41.899
Wow, look at that!

66
00:03:41.966 --> 00:03:44.899
Fletchling's flying lots better now too!

67
00:03:44.966 --> 00:03:47.266
It's adjusting the angle of its tail feathers

68
00:03:47.333 --> 00:03:49.399
to control how the air flows around it!

69
00:03:49.466 --> 00:03:53.266
Now, Pikachu, use Thunderbolt! And Fletchling, Razor Wind!

70
00:03:53.333 --> 00:03:56.399
- Pikachu!
- Fletchling!

71
00:03:56.466 --> 00:03:58.600
All right, Noivern, dodge it!

72
00:03:58.666 --> 00:04:01.200
Noivern!

73
00:04:04.500 --> 00:04:06.466
Awesome! Looking good you two!

74
00:04:06.533 --> 00:04:08.266
- Pikachu.
- Fletching.

75
00:04:08.333 --> 00:04:11.866
Looks like you're getting the hang of it. But I'm not finished yet!

76
00:04:11.933 --> 00:04:12.833
Use Gust, again!

77
00:04:21.066 --> 00:04:26.266
Wow, Alexa, that was some really helpful training! Thank you for everything.

78
00:04:26.333 --> 00:04:30.433
Save your thanks until after you defeat my sister and win your first Kalos Gym badge.

79
00:04:30.500 --> 00:04:32.233
Right! I'll do my best!

80
00:04:32.300 --> 00:04:36.133
- Pika, pika.
- Ling, Ling.

81
00:04:36.200 --> 00:04:39.500
Hm. We've got a good defense against Gust now!

82
00:04:39.566 --> 00:04:42.833
So that means, uh, now you just need to figure out

83
00:04:42.900 --> 00:04:45.233
the ice battlefield and Sticky Web and Psychic!

84
00:04:45.300 --> 00:04:48.733
I've already figured out how to deal with the ice battlefield.

85
00:04:48.800 --> 00:04:52.666
- Yeah? What're you going to do?
- You'll find out during the battle.

86
00:04:52.733 --> 00:04:56.533
Hey, that's no fun.

87
00:04:56.599 --> 00:04:59.733
Well, as far as handling Sticky Web, you just leave that to me!

88
00:04:59.800 --> 00:05:04.133
Yes! All right, Pikachu and Fletchling, it's back to training after we eat!

89
00:05:11.366 --> 00:05:13.300
Allow me to help you with your training

90
00:05:13.366 --> 00:05:16.133
using the very best of my scientific skills!

91
00:05:16.200 --> 00:05:19.099
Remember, the future is now, thanks to science!

92
00:05:19.166 --> 00:05:23.599
And the power of technology! Clemontic Gear, on!

93
00:05:23.666 --> 00:05:28.533
I invented this device in anticipation of the very situation Ash is now in!

94
00:05:28.599 --> 00:05:32.333
I call it the Sticky Web Sticky-Wicket Wacker Wonk!

95
00:05:32.400 --> 00:05:33.933
- Huh?
- Denne?

96
00:05:34.000 --> 00:05:36.433
Science is so amazing!

97
00:05:36.500 --> 00:05:39.666
I've analyzed Sticky Web's composition at the DNA level

98
00:05:39.733 --> 00:05:42.333
and this device is able to replicate its stickiness,

99
00:05:42.400 --> 00:05:45.633
color, aroma and nutritional value to a tee!

100
00:05:45.700 --> 00:05:48.433
I'm sure patent approval is right around the corner!

101
00:05:48.500 --> 00:05:52.000
Well, I really don't know what you're talking about but thanks, Clemont!

102
00:05:52.066 --> 00:05:54.433
So let's get started!

103
00:05:54.500 --> 00:05:58.833
Lock on target and... fire!

104
00:05:59.800 --> 00:06:01.700
Dodge it!

105
00:06:03.666 --> 00:06:05.833
Pik! Pika!

106
00:06:05.900 --> 00:06:08.366
He's right! It's the same as Sticky Web!

107
00:06:08.433 --> 00:06:13.366
This is what I call training with science! Keep it up! Fire! Fire! Fire!

108
00:06:13.433 --> 00:06:15.500
Pik! Pika! Pik!

109
00:06:15.566 --> 00:06:17.000
Ling! Ling! Ling! Ling!

110
00:06:17.066 --> 00:06:18.700
Hey, you're both looking great!

111
00:06:21.733 --> 00:06:24.566
- Pika! Pika!
- Fletchling! Fletch!

112
00:06:24.633 --> 00:06:29.566
Not bad. But you haven't experienced my device working at full power!

113
00:06:29.633 --> 00:06:33.200
Maximum level and fire!

114
00:06:34.500 --> 00:06:37.533
Huh? Something's not right.

115
00:06:37.599 --> 00:06:39.766
Oh! Ah!

116
00:06:43.566 --> 00:06:46.500
Hm? Oh! Ah!

117
00:06:51.566 --> 00:06:54.099
Looks like another machine went boom.

118
00:06:54.166 --> 00:06:57.966
Oh! Why? Why?

119
00:06:58.033 --> 00:07:03.133
Okay, in that case. All right, Froakie! I choose you!

120
00:07:05.299 --> 00:07:06.666
Froakie! Kie!

121
00:07:06.733 --> 00:07:08.733
If you attack us with your Frubbles,

122
00:07:08.799 --> 00:07:11.666
it'll be like getting attacked with Sticky Web!

123
00:07:11.733 --> 00:07:13.566
Froakie!

124
00:07:13.633 --> 00:07:15.533
Quick, Pikachu, Fletchling, dodge it!

125
00:07:18.133 --> 00:07:19.400
Pika! Pika!

126
00:07:19.466 --> 00:07:22.066
Wow! What a clever way to use Frubbles!

127
00:07:22.133 --> 00:07:24.333
- Yeah! Keep it up!
- Na-na-nah!

128
00:07:24.400 --> 00:07:27.033
- Now, concentrate and speed up!
- Pika!

129
00:07:27.099 --> 00:07:28.933
Froakie!

130
00:07:29.000 --> 00:07:31.333
-Show me that spirit!

131
00:07:31.400 --> 00:07:33.866
I didn't know Ash had a Froakie too!

132
00:07:33.933 --> 00:07:37.599
That Froakie's from Professor Sycamore's research lab.

133
00:07:37.666 --> 00:07:39.333
Just like my Fennekin!

134
00:07:39.400 --> 00:07:43.766
- Pika! Pika!
- Fletch! Fletchling! Fletch!

135
00:07:43.833 --> 00:07:46.000
- Fletch! Fletch!
- Pika!

136
00:07:46.066 --> 00:07:50.099
I think we're going to be just fine, so let's call it a day!

137
00:07:50.166 --> 00:07:54.866
- Pikachu!
- Froakie! Fro! Froakie!

138
00:07:54.933 --> 00:07:57.766
- Fro!
- Fletchling!

139
00:07:57.833 --> 00:08:02.733
Ra, ra, ra! Go team, go! I know you can do it. You're awesome!

140
00:08:02.799 --> 00:08:04.799
Bonnie, I think it's bedtime.

141
00:08:04.866 --> 00:08:09.266
- Hm. You were great.
- Yeah, weren't they? Let's go.

142
00:08:09.333 --> 00:08:10.333
Pikachu.

143
00:08:10.400 --> 00:08:13.933
Okay Ash, I'm going to tuck Bonnie into bed.

144
00:08:14.000 --> 00:08:16.933
Right! Thanks for staying up so late and helping me out!

145
00:08:17.000 --> 00:08:20.799
Concentrate and speed up.

146
00:08:22.566 --> 00:08:24.866
Well, we all worked on everything we could.

147
00:08:24.933 --> 00:08:27.633
All that's left is to battle Viola as hard as we can.

148
00:08:27.700 --> 00:08:29.299
So let's give it all we've got!

149
00:08:29.366 --> 00:08:30.733
- Pika!
- Fletchling!

150
00:08:30.799 --> 00:08:31.799
Froakie!

151
00:08:31.866 --> 00:08:34.900
It's amazing how hard Trainers and their Pokémon work!

152
00:08:34.966 --> 00:08:39.066
It takes an awful lot of time and effort to earn yourself a Gym badge, doesn't it?

153
00:08:39.133 --> 00:08:41.033
You'll be training like this in no time!

154
00:08:41.100 --> 00:08:43.966
Soon you're going to hit the road and catch some more Pokémon

155
00:08:44.033 --> 00:08:46.800
so you can challenge the Pokémon Gyms, right?

156
00:08:46.866 --> 00:08:51.533
I guess so. I know I have Fennekin, but I'm not sure what my next step will be.

157
00:08:51.600 --> 00:08:54.600
Got you, so take your time and you'll know what to do.

158
00:08:54.666 --> 00:08:56.533
- Hm?
- Pikachu!

159
00:08:56.600 --> 00:09:00.933
Huh? Hm, I will. Thank you!

160
00:09:06.800 --> 00:09:09.633
The Gym battle rematch between Ash, the challenger,

161
00:09:09.699 --> 00:09:13.400
and Viola, the Santalune Gym Leader, will now begin!

162
00:09:13.466 --> 00:09:15.466
- I heard you.
- Hm?

163
00:09:15.533 --> 00:09:19.866
When you and Ash were having your talk. He needed some inspiration,

164
00:09:19.933 --> 00:09:22.933
but I didn't think it was going to come from you.

165
00:09:23.000 --> 00:09:25.533
Each side will have the use of two Pokémon

166
00:09:25.600 --> 00:09:30.300
and the battle will be over when either Trainer's Pokémon are unable to continue!

167
00:09:30.366 --> 00:09:32.733
Only the challenger may substitute Pokémon!

168
00:09:32.800 --> 00:09:36.466
So, Ash, my sister tells me you were training hard yesterday.

169
00:09:36.533 --> 00:09:37.966
I'm looking forward to this!

170
00:09:38.033 --> 00:09:41.333
Yeah, me too, because this time I'm going to win a badge!

171
00:09:41.400 --> 00:09:42.466
Pikachu!

172
00:09:42.533 --> 00:09:45.800
My lens is still focused on victory and nothing will ruin this shot!

173
00:09:45.866 --> 00:09:46.966
Go, Surskit!

174
00:09:48.100 --> 00:09:49.166
Surskit!

175
00:09:49.233 --> 00:09:51.900
Time to even the score, right, Pikachu?

176
00:09:51.966 --> 00:09:53.166
Pika! Pika!

177
00:09:53.233 --> 00:09:55.400
Battle begin!

178
00:10:01.233 --> 00:10:04.100
They're waiting to see Surskit's first move.

179
00:10:04.166 --> 00:10:06.933
Ash and Pikachu, get them, get them, get them!

180
00:10:07.000 --> 00:10:08.166
Dedenne!

181
00:10:08.233 --> 00:10:10.533
You can't take a picture without pressing the shutter

182
00:10:10.600 --> 00:10:12.900
and you can't win a battle without attacking!

183
00:10:12.966 --> 00:10:16.900
All right, Surskit, use Sticky Web!

184
00:10:16.966 --> 00:10:19.033
Dodge it, Pikachu!

185
00:10:20.466 --> 00:10:22.166
- Huh?
- Wow, that's fast!

186
00:10:22.233 --> 00:10:23.733
All that training's paying off!

187
00:10:23.800 --> 00:10:25.833
Now, Pikachu, use Thunderbolt!

188
00:10:25.900 --> 00:10:28.900
Pikachu!

189
00:10:28.966 --> 00:10:31.500
Surskit, Protect!

190
00:10:32.699 --> 00:10:36.233
- Signal Beam, go!
- Surskit!

191
00:10:36.300 --> 00:10:39.066
- Dodge, then Iron Tail!
- Pika!

192
00:10:39.133 --> 00:10:41.133
Pika!

193
00:10:44.300 --> 00:10:45.466
Surskit!

194
00:10:45.533 --> 00:10:49.033
- All right!
- Yay! Pikachu really nailed it!

195
00:10:49.100 --> 00:10:51.633
Iron Tail isn't that effective against Surskit,

196
00:10:51.699 --> 00:10:55.400
but considering how Pikachu wasn't able to land an attack at all last time,

197
00:10:55.466 --> 00:10:57.466
it was a meaningful hit!

198
00:10:58.466 --> 00:11:00.433
Now, let's refocus this battle!

199
00:11:00.500 --> 00:11:03.466
Time to use Ice Beam and create an ice battlefield!

200
00:11:05.000 --> 00:11:07.933
- Don't let Surskit use Ice Beam!
- Pikachu!

201
00:11:10.500 --> 00:11:14.000
- Stay on it and use Thunderbolt!
- Shake it loose and use Ice Beam!

202
00:11:21.866 --> 00:11:25.233
-Pika!

203
00:11:25.300 --> 00:11:27.566
Pika!

204
00:11:28.566 --> 00:11:29.666
Pikachu, dodge it!

205
00:11:29.733 --> 00:11:34.733
Pi! Pi! Pika!

206
00:11:34.800 --> 00:11:36.233
Pikachu!

207
00:11:41.066 --> 00:11:43.233
Who's that Pokémon?

208
00:11:48.066 --> 00:11:50.000
It's Noivern!

209
00:11:54.800 --> 00:11:58.466
Another picture-perfect ice battlefield!

210
00:11:58.533 --> 00:12:01.066
Surskit, start skating!

211
00:12:04.133 --> 00:12:06.800
- It's just like the last battle!
- Dedenne!

212
00:12:06.866 --> 00:12:09.400
The difference is Ash trained really hard for this one!

213
00:12:09.466 --> 00:12:13.366
- Can you get up, Pikachu?
- Pika! Pikachu!

214
00:12:13.433 --> 00:12:15.600
This ice battlefield is my studio!

215
00:12:15.666 --> 00:12:18.366
I'm the photographer and I call the shots!

216
00:12:18.433 --> 00:12:21.233
Surskit, Signal Beam!

217
00:12:21.300 --> 00:12:24.000
- Now, Pikachu!
- Pika!

218
00:12:25.133 --> 00:12:27.366
That's the thing Ash wouldn't tell us about!

219
00:12:27.433 --> 00:12:29.900
How he was going to deal with the ice battlefield!

220
00:12:29.966 --> 00:12:32.000
Way to go! Now use Thunderbolt!

221
00:12:32.066 --> 00:12:37.000
Pika! Pikachu!

222
00:12:41.800 --> 00:12:45.666
Surskit, no!

223
00:12:45.733 --> 00:12:48.500
Surskit is unable to battle! Pikachu wins!

224
00:12:49.966 --> 00:12:52.500
- We did it!
- Pikachu!

225
00:12:55.433 --> 00:12:57.633
Pikachu would plant its tail to stay balanced.

226
00:12:59.066 --> 00:13:02.199
Surskit, that was excellent. Now, get a good rest.

227
00:13:02.266 --> 00:13:04.266
Pikachu, return!

228
00:13:04.333 --> 00:13:06.800
- Pikachu!
- What?

229
00:13:06.866 --> 00:13:09.166
You're done battling with Pikachu?

230
00:13:09.233 --> 00:13:12.599
Fletchling wants a chance for a rematch against Vivillon too!

231
00:13:12.666 --> 00:13:14.933
Fletchling, I choose you!

232
00:13:16.733 --> 00:13:17.900
Fletchling!

233
00:13:17.966 --> 00:13:20.900
Picture-perfect! Let's do this, Vivillon!

234
00:13:22.166 --> 00:13:23.400
Vivillon!

235
00:13:23.466 --> 00:13:26.500
They won't have to worry about Sticky Web this time!

236
00:13:26.566 --> 00:13:28.866
And Ash can thank Pikachu for that!

237
00:13:28.933 --> 00:13:30.866
They also have a great counter for Gust!

238
00:13:30.933 --> 00:13:32.900
This is not yesterday's battle, for sure!

239
00:13:32.966 --> 00:13:35.466
All right, Fletchling, Steel Wing, let's go!

240
00:13:35.533 --> 00:13:42.433
Fletchling! Ling!

241
00:13:42.500 --> 00:13:47.199
- Use Psychic!
- Fletch?

242
00:13:52.199 --> 00:13:56.433
Fletchling, no! Be strong! Now, get up!

243
00:13:56.500 --> 00:13:57.566
Fletch!

244
00:13:57.633 --> 00:14:03.133
- Great, Fletchling! Steel Wing!
- Fletch! Fletchling!

245
00:14:04.466 --> 00:14:07.133
- Huh?
- Way to go! Now, use Peck!

246
00:14:07.199 --> 00:14:09.666
Fletchling!

247
00:14:09.733 --> 00:14:13.099
- Dodge it, quick!
- Ling! Ling!

248
00:14:13.166 --> 00:14:15.033
All right! Use Gust!

249
00:14:19.966 --> 00:14:22.666
- Fletch!
- Remember our training, Fletchling!

250
00:14:22.733 --> 00:14:28.400
- Pika!
- Fletch! Fletchling! Fletch!

251
00:14:28.466 --> 00:14:30.300
Great, Fletchling, ride it!

252
00:14:30.366 --> 00:14:31.900
Yeah, you can do it!

253
00:14:31.966 --> 00:14:36.099
- Fletchling, use Razor Wind now!
- Fletchling!

254
00:14:36.166 --> 00:14:38.166
Vivillon, Sleep Powder!

255
00:14:44.300 --> 00:14:46.300
Fletchling, wake up!

256
00:14:46.366 --> 00:14:49.133
I had no idea Vivillon could use Sleep Powder!

257
00:14:49.199 --> 00:14:52.033
- Uh-oh.
- Pikachu!

258
00:14:52.099 --> 00:14:55.099
Excellent! Picture-perfect! Vivillon, Solar Beam!

259
00:15:00.933 --> 00:15:03.233
Oh, no! Fletchling!

260
00:15:05.166 --> 00:15:06.500
- Pika!
- Fletchling...

261
00:15:06.566 --> 00:15:09.599
Fletchling is unable to battle! Vivillon wins!

262
00:15:09.666 --> 00:15:13.166
- Aw, poor Fletchling lost.
- Na-na.

263
00:15:13.233 --> 00:15:16.599
There's no way my sister would let Ash win without a real fight.

264
00:15:16.666 --> 00:15:19.800
- That's okay! We believe in Ash!
- Huh?

265
00:15:22.099 --> 00:15:25.333
Good job. You battled hard, Fletchling, so get lots of rest.

266
00:15:25.400 --> 00:15:28.233
I need you to get back in there, Pikachu.

267
00:15:28.300 --> 00:15:30.833
Pikachu! Pika!

268
00:15:30.900 --> 00:15:33.166
Now, Vivillon, use Gust!

269
00:15:34.800 --> 00:15:36.599
Pika!

270
00:15:36.666 --> 00:15:40.233
Hang tough, Pikachu! You can stay on your feet.

271
00:15:42.300 --> 00:15:45.300
Pikachu's still feeling the effects of the battle with Surskit!

272
00:15:45.366 --> 00:15:48.233
If this drags on, it could be at a real disadvantage!

273
00:15:48.300 --> 00:15:50.099
Pikachu!

274
00:15:50.166 --> 00:15:52.266
Pikachu can't beat my Vivillon in that state.

275
00:15:52.333 --> 00:15:55.233
I'm afraid you're going to have to wait longer for your badge.

276
00:15:55.300 --> 00:15:57.300
Yeah, well, there's no way we're giving up!

277
00:15:57.366 --> 00:15:58.866
That's not what we're about!

278
00:15:58.933 --> 00:16:01.300
We'll keep battling right up until the very end!

279
00:16:01.366 --> 00:16:04.633
- Huh?
- Don't give up till it's over!

280
00:16:05.800 --> 00:16:08.933
I admire your persistence, but this is the end!

281
00:16:09.000 --> 00:16:10.566
Gust, one more time!

282
00:16:13.500 --> 00:16:17.699
- Pikachu! Iron Tail, let's go!
- Pikachu!

283
00:16:17.766 --> 00:16:20.800
Pika! Pika!

284
00:16:20.866 --> 00:16:22.833
-It's using Iron Tail!

285
00:16:22.900 --> 00:16:24.900
Another great way to stay put!

286
00:16:24.966 --> 00:16:26.733
Pikachu is so cool!

287
00:16:26.800 --> 00:16:31.233
Pretty clever, but you just made it even easier for me to focus!

288
00:16:31.300 --> 00:16:36.966
Vivillon, use Solar Beam!

289
00:16:37.033 --> 00:16:43.900
- Pikachu, use Thunderbolt!
- Pikachu!

290
00:16:44.866 --> 00:16:47.699
Argh! Vivillon, Sleep Powder!

291
00:16:47.766 --> 00:16:51.866
-Pika! Pi! Pi! Pika...

292
00:16:51.933 --> 00:16:54.599
Pika...

293
00:16:54.666 --> 00:16:56.566
Pikachu!

294
00:16:56.633 --> 00:17:00.633
So here we are. It's my chance to take a great last picture!

295
00:17:00.699 --> 00:17:03.633
Pikachu! Ash! You've got to hang in there!

296
00:17:03.699 --> 00:17:07.200
Let's finish this up! Solar Beam!

297
00:17:07.266 --> 00:17:09.200
Pikachu! Wake up!

298
00:17:09.266 --> 00:17:11.200
Pika...

299
00:17:11.266 --> 00:17:14.266
Remember your training from yesterday!

300
00:17:14.333 --> 00:17:18.333
Ah. Pikachu! Use Electro Ball on yourself!

301
00:17:18.399 --> 00:17:21.800
Pika. Pika. Pika. Pika! Pika! Pika!

302
00:17:21.866 --> 00:17:25.000
-Pik!

303
00:17:32.066 --> 00:17:34.000
-Pika!

304
00:17:34.066 --> 00:17:35.166
All right!

305
00:17:35.233 --> 00:17:38.433
It neutralized Sleep Powder with an Electric-type move on itself!

306
00:17:38.500 --> 00:17:40.933
Heh-heh! That's so very, very Ash!

307
00:17:41.000 --> 00:17:44.133
Vivillon, Solar Beam!

308
00:17:44.200 --> 00:17:46.866
We're all with you, so put everything into this move!

309
00:17:46.933 --> 00:17:51.333
- Use Electro Ball!
- Pika! Pika! Pika! Pikachu!

310
00:17:53.833 --> 00:17:56.533
-Vivillon, no!

311
00:18:03.066 --> 00:18:05.533
- Come on, Vivillon, be strong!
- Uh-oh.

312
00:18:05.600 --> 00:18:07.833
Vivillon's flying kind of weird all of a sudden.

313
00:18:07.899 --> 00:18:11.133
Look at its wing! It's covered with ice!

314
00:18:11.200 --> 00:18:13.733
No. How can this be?

315
00:18:13.800 --> 00:18:15.866
Pikachu! Now use Thunderbolt!

316
00:18:15.933 --> 00:18:21.033
Pikachu!

317
00:18:26.933 --> 00:18:29.233
Vivillon, no!

318
00:18:29.300 --> 00:18:32.233
Vivillon is unable to battle! Pikachu wins!

319
00:18:32.300 --> 00:18:34.899
Which means the winner of the match is Ash!

320
00:18:34.966 --> 00:18:36.399
All right!

321
00:18:36.466 --> 00:18:39.899
- Pika! Pi!
- Ha-ha. We did it, Pikachu!

322
00:18:39.966 --> 00:18:41.899
Ash!

323
00:18:41.966 --> 00:18:45.433
- Ash that was amazing!
- Happy, happy, Bonnie!

324
00:18:45.500 --> 00:18:47.399
Way to go, Ash! You were great!

325
00:18:47.466 --> 00:18:50.966
Hey, thanks and I couldn't have done it without help from you guys.

326
00:18:51.033 --> 00:18:53.899
Ash, I had nothing to do with your win and you know it!

327
00:18:53.966 --> 00:18:57.100
Nah, your invention gave me the idea.

328
00:18:57.166 --> 00:18:58.399
Huh?

329
00:19:00.533 --> 00:19:03.666
You mean, my invention's failure gave you the idea

330
00:19:03.733 --> 00:19:05.966
of Pikachu using Electro Ball on itself?

331
00:19:06.033 --> 00:19:09.166
Yup and that's why this victory doesn't just belong to me!

332
00:19:09.233 --> 00:19:12.733
- It's all of ours!
- Pika, pika!

333
00:19:12.800 --> 00:19:16.899
- Thank you, Vivillon, for a great battle.
- What did I tell you about Ash?

334
00:19:16.966 --> 00:19:20.700
Yeah, you knew it all along!

335
00:19:20.766 --> 00:19:23.700
- Ash?
- Hey, Viola.

336
00:19:23.766 --> 00:19:27.933
Congratulations. This is to prove you won your Gym battle against me.

337
00:19:28.000 --> 00:19:29.666
The Bug Badge.

338
00:19:29.733 --> 00:19:31.933
Thanks so much!

339
00:19:32.000 --> 00:19:37.433
- All right! I just got the Bug Badge!
- Pikachu!

340
00:19:42.466 --> 00:19:44.566
There are some things you can only see

341
00:19:44.633 --> 00:19:46.666
when looking through a camera's viewfinder

342
00:19:46.733 --> 00:19:50.100
and things you'll only see clearly by living together with Pokémon.

343
00:19:50.166 --> 00:19:54.066
Keep strengthening the bonds you share with your Pokémon and good luck!

344
00:19:54.133 --> 00:19:55.600
- Thanks!
- Pika!

345
00:19:55.666 --> 00:19:59.700
Ash, I imagine you're heading to your next Pokémon Gym battle.

346
00:19:59.766 --> 00:20:02.533
In that case, how about the Gym in Cyllage City?

347
00:20:02.600 --> 00:20:06.100
Cyllage City Gym, that sounds great!

348
00:20:06.166 --> 00:20:08.566
-You take care, Helioptile.

349
00:20:08.633 --> 00:20:11.566
Pika! Pika!

350
00:20:11.633 --> 00:20:14.633
Okay, then, we're going to head out! Thanks again!

351
00:20:14.700 --> 00:20:16.766
- Pika! Pika!
- Bye, bye!

352
00:20:16.833 --> 00:20:20.500
Viola, Alexa, Helioptile, bye!

353
00:20:23.233 --> 00:20:26.066
I'll be seeing you all again really soon!

354
00:20:27.500 --> 00:20:31.600
And so, after two hard-fought battles against Gym Leader Viola,

355
00:20:31.666 --> 00:20:33.666
Ash has received the Bug Badge!

356
00:20:33.733 --> 00:20:36.866
Now, our heroes set off to the Cyllage City Gym,

357
00:20:36.933 --> 00:20:39.100
as the journey continues!

358
00:20:40.466 --> 00:20:43.000
So, Serena, where are you headed off to from here?

359
00:20:43.066 --> 00:20:45.366
Uh, me?
